## Note

Happens when the gun is disabled mid-shot.

Repro: start a run, die while shooting.

**Tags:** `crash` `scene 3`

## What this might be

**Crashed in your game code (≈ SampleGame.Enemies.EnemySpawner.Spawn)** (line 75)

- GameAssembly is your C# compiled by IL2CPP; the method name above is rebuilt from IL2CPP's mangled name. Start there.
- A managed exception logged just before the crash often explains it.
- The crash report folder has a .dmp file to open in Visual Studio or WinDbg.

